  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760376,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 2 Games in 1: Sonic Advance + ChuChu Rocket! - A Double Dose of Game Boy Advance Fun!\n\nRelive the golden age of platforming with *2 Games in 1: Sonic Advance + ChuChu Rocket!*, a fantastic compilation for the Game Boy Advance. This cartridge delivers two complete and distinct gaming experiences, offering incredible value and a diverse range of gameplay.\n\nFirst, experience the vibrant and fast-paced world of *Sonic Advance*. Join Sonic the Hedgehog and his friends as they battle Dr. Eggman across colorful zones, collecting rings, defeating enemies, and uncovering hidden secrets. Featuring classic Sonic gameplay with a fresh, GBA twist, it's a perfect blend of nostalgia and innovation.\n\nThen, switch gears to the quirky and addictive puzzle-action of *ChuChu Rocket!*. Guide adorable ChuChus to their rocket ships by strategically placing obstacles and manipulating their movement. It's a deceptively simple concept with surprising depth, offering hours of challenging and rewarding gameplay.\n\nChoose your adventure with a convenient menu, and enjoy two incredible games in one convenient cartridge!"
    },
